{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Think <strong>Rescue Rover</strong>, <strong>Bolo Adventures</strong>, <strong>Puzzle Pits</strong>, <strong>Adventures of Lolo</strong> and <strong>Capt'n Squiddy's Bootleg Push-Push</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong><i>100</i></strong> main campaign levels, <strong>30</strong> additional mission levels <i>plus</i> <strong>secret world levels and endings</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Cute, anti-heroic protagonist with an adorably utilitarian personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Original</strong> ambient virtual-analog synthesizer soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Super slick gameplay on Windows! Modern graphical slickness and smooth 165fps+ motion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Occasional pop culture references to nineties gaming and music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Dozens of <strong>Sokoban</strong>-style mechanics and gameplay designs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 10+ unique <strong>enemies</strong> lurking throughout the game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Occasional novelty level structures! Pathfinding enemies! Environmental effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/Timeline_2.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>E</strong>ver wanted to <strong>push</strong>, <i>push</i>, <u>push </u>your way to success? Feelin' a little desperate to glide into position? Movin', groovin' and cruisin' through an isometric tile-space of colorful, pre-rendered visuals and cool-toon characters? Look no further, <i><strong>Bryce Tiles</strong></i> is here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/header_1.png?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared for a box-pushing time! Bryce Tiles is a post- MSDOSWare game set in the early 00's! Bryce has discovered a new time portal in his Klik 'N' Complete Box and has used it once more to return to 25 years ago, when EuroMaxi K&amp;C was shared by Nash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an entirely isometric Meiersian world, he pushes, slides, swims, flees, rolls and collects the missing instruments around more than 130 levels of nostalgic sokoban action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just take your little man and push him around... seriously, it's never been easier! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/snow.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/bryce_gif.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up, down, left, right, hit all those hard-to-reach spots (not diagonally though!) and make it out of the level as fast as you can... or in as few amount as pushes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/header_2.png?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll encounter sinking sands, still (but deep!) waters, dangerously fast rapids, moving floors, slidey ice and burning hot coals as you push those boxes around! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/wiz.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan ahead and determine which pushable object is most suitable for the environment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/header_3.png?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rolling balls (hint: they don't stop by themselves!), Scrump The Ruff\u2122, laser beams (with mirrors to reflect them... yes, we know where you saw them first!)...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/balls.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/bryce_gif3.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...locked doors, push-pads, it's all there to try and confuse you... but you'll stay one step ahead! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/header_4.png?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of tricks and traps to keep you busy, challenging puzzle designs and beautifully pre-rendered surroundings to keep you entertained for hours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/greekie.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/bryce_gif4.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's only one Bryce Tiles!\u00a0\u2193\u2193\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/stroll_bryce2.png?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Theme song sung by Marn\u00e9e)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Autumn Hills Complete!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2144990/8353f96087ae78ed19b6e055b41b085cb2038c1d.jpg"},{"name":"Sandy Plains Done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2144990/7a5888d721b5dafe8c056121caf45cb4ce7c06f7.jpg"},{"name":"Galaxy Way Finished!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2144990/463bc9f3703813d35463b0e4985f010f8b72a201.jpg"},{"name":"Kellogge Farms Finalized!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2144990/0a74ca96e43446c5aeac6f84c439f118aee3004c.jpg"},{"name":"Shorecastle Sands Complete!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2144990/a44348eb6ad1bb7d0262618b4e65ddfe8be1c10c.jpg"},{"name":"Snow Falls Finalized!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2144990/e0c4d832f9e197598ddceb32e20ffe60683ac030.jpg"},{"name":"Toyland Trounced!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2144990/dd350b775d5d83cd6efb3c51ed95602aa6b776d5.jpg"},{"name":"Magicland Mastered!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2144990/25a9340096e7d8d535b0c7a5dd3121cfd3f09f93.jpg"},{"name":"Ludwig's Library (Quietly) Page-To-Page'd!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2144990/66b6e025bc80b0189fe91d1a0c99dd41d5a8122b.jpg"},{"name":"Grecopolis Grounds Concluded!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2144990/e60a1ea01ec837ec794d9879dc646811073a95a8.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2144990?t=1746048760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746048760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746048760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746048760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Think <strong>Rescue Rover</strong>, <strong>Bolo Adventures</strong>, <strong>Puzzle Pits</strong>, <strong>Adventures of Lolo</strong> and <strong>Capt'n Squiddy's Bootleg Push-Push</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong><i>100</i></strong> main campaign levels, <strong>30</strong> additional mission levels <i>plus</i> <strong>secret world levels and endings</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Cute, anti-heroic protagonist with an adorably utilitarian personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Original</strong> ambient virtual-analog synthesizer soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Super slick gameplay on Windows! Modern graphical slickness and smooth 165fps+ motion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Occasional pop culture references to nineties gaming and music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Dozens of <strong>Sokoban</strong>-style mechanics and gameplay designs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 10+ unique <strong>enemies</strong> lurking throughout the game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Occasional novelty level structures! Pathfinding enemies! Environmental effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/Timeline_2.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>E</strong>ver wanted to <strong>push</strong>, <i>push</i>, <u>push </u>your way to success? Feelin' a little desperate to glide into position? Movin', groovin' and cruisin' through an isometric tile-space of colorful, pre-rendered visuals and cool-toon characters? Look no further, <i><strong>Bryce Tiles</strong></i> is here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/header_1.png?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared for a box-pushing time! Bryce Tiles is a post- MSDOSWare game set in the early 00's! Bryce has discovered a new time portal in his Klik 'N' Complete Box and has used it once more to return to 25 years ago, when EuroMaxi K&amp;C was shared by Nash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an entirely isometric Meiersian world, he pushes, slides, swims, flees, rolls and collects the missing instruments around more than 130 levels of nostalgic sokoban action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just take your little man and push him around... seriously, it's never been easier! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/snow.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/bryce_gif.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up, down, left, right, hit all those hard-to-reach spots (not diagonally though!) and make it out of the level as fast as you can... or in as few amount as pushes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/header_2.png?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll encounter sinking sands, still (but deep!) waters, dangerously fast rapids, moving floors, slidey ice and burning hot coals as you push those boxes around! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/wiz.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan ahead and determine which pushable object is most suitable for the environment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/header_3.png?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rolling balls (hint: they don't stop by themselves!), Scrump The Ruff\u2122, laser beams (with mirrors to reflect them... yes, we know where you saw them first!)...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/balls.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/bryce_gif3.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...locked doors, push-pads, it's all there to try and confuse you... but you'll stay one step ahead! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/header_4.png?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of tricks and traps to keep you busy, challenging puzzle designs and beautifully pre-rendered surroundings to keep you entertained for hours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/greekie.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/bryce_gif4.gif?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's only one Bryce Tiles!\u00a0\u2193\u2193\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/stroll_bryce2.png?t=1746048760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Theme song sung by Marn\u00e9e)</p>","developers":["Brilliance","Brilliance Games"],"dlc":[3663740],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/header.jpg?t=1746048760","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 400 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 2.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131135,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131135/movie480.mp4?t=1745622168","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131135/movie_max.mp4?t=1745622168"},"name":"Bryce's Second Signature Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131135/4c8cd96dfc44938cc54a81e5e6a8b95f25c7319e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745622168","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131135/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745622168","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131135/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745622168"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256926389,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256926389/movie480.mp4?t=1745622171","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256926389/movie_max.mp4?t=1745622171"},"name":"Bryce's Signature Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256926389/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1745622171","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256926389/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745622171","max":"http